type: software
title: "solidfunc: a typed, functional Python CAD API on the SolidCore kernel"
abstract: >-
  An experiment in how much parametric code-based CAD depends on its geometry
  kernel: a typed, functional Python API built on SolidCore, a B-rep kernel
  written in Rust, instead of OpenCascade.
